@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## Why
+
+Clients want to send only what changed between two versions of a JSON document. The library can apply RFC 6902 patches but cannot produce them.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `createPatch(from, to)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returning an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that `applyPatch` turns from `from` into `to`.
+- The patch is a structural diff: it recurses into objects and arrays and emits only the operations needed, never a whole-document replacement when a small part changed.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-patch-diff`: generating a minimal RFC 6902 patch between two JSON documents.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New file `src/diff.ts`, export in `src/index.ts`, `equal` exported from `src/patch.ts` for reuse, new tests. No dependencies.
